From: RDNA4 local integration
Subject: [PATCH 17/17] radv/darwin: fully backed composite buffers in one GPU VA

Split large native Private allocations into bounded physical BOs without sparse
operations or duplicate child VA reservations. Expand submission references and
preserve metadata, readonly mappings, exact teardown and error reporting.

Base: f5cb8ee032adabef599ae892ec4e42d796b84da9 with patches 0001..0016.

